      "filename": "EB1911 Greek Art - Hermes of Praxiteles (2).jpg",
      "title": "File:EB1911 Greek Art - Hermes of Praxiteles (2).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/EB1911_Greek_Art_-_Hermes_of_Praxiteles_%282%29.jpg",
